helpers/download/download_aams.py, download_tabacchi.py, download_agcom.py
and download_consob.py derive from the upstream helpers. CONSOB is modified to
reject partial fetches. The new core, configuration, deployment and parsers
replace the former shell/Perl pipeline; redirect settings derive from upstream.
The IVASS adapter is rewritten using the standard library and optional pypdf.

helpers/download/tlds.txt is a snapshot of IANA's public root-zone TLD list:
https://data.iana.org/TLD/tlds-alpha-by-domain.txt
Snapshot version is recorded in its first line. It is data, not a blocklist.
